  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds QRCode and report QR elements with stable field binding and vector PDF output. Hardens report data-source steps, table-column editing and transactional PDF saves. Adds bound multi-select workflow identities, consistent property templates, compact node items and resizable side panels. Optimizes Gantt single-task updates and chart subscriptions, sampling and drawing caches; remaining ScatterChart raster p99 limits are documented. Uses explicit compiled bindings and removes historical preview test startup branches. Requires .NET 10 and Avalonia 12.1.4; upgrade both TheOne packages to preview.6. NuGet upload is manual.",
